CORROSION. 

1ST TROOP HAS BEEN ORDERED ON IT'S FINAL MISSION. INVADING 
MLF FORCES HAVE IGNORED THE GENEVA CONVENTIONS AND TARGETED 
CIVILIAN AREAS. MLF FORCES HAVE ALSO LITTERED THE FIELD WITH 
THE REMAINS OF 2ND TROOP.

ASSUMING A COURSE HEADING OF 136ø SOUTH BY SOUTH EAST, 1ST TROOP 
IS TO SANCTION ANY COMMUNICATIONS LINKS WITHIN THE MLF/AMERICAN
CONTROLLED ZONE. THIS WILL LEAD YOUR TROOP TO THE ENEMY'S COMMAND 
ENCAMPMENT. SANCTION ALL ELEMENTS WITHIN THE MLF COMPOUND.

THE REMAINING UNITS OF 2ND TROOP ARE ORDERED TO CONTINUE ALONG 
THEIR COURSE HEADING OF 186ø IN SUPPORT OF 1ST TROOP. SHOULD 1ST 
TROOP FAIL IN IT'S MISSION OBJECTIVE, 2ND TROOP IS AUTHORIZED TO 
COMPLETE ALL REMAINING TASKS.

1ST TROOP'S ARTILLERY SUPPORT UNIT HAS NOT REACHED IT'S 
DESIGNATED AREA OF OPERATIONS. THERE MAY BE A DELAY IN CALLING IN 
FIRE SUPPORT.
